{"seq":1,"slug":"streaming-tts","title":"流式语音合成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/engineering/streaming-tts","wordCount":972,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"流式语音合成\">流式语音合成</h1><p>在语音助手、同声传译和 AI 实时对话等场景中，用户期望说完话的瞬间就能听到回复。流式 TTS（Streaming TTS）的核心目标是在文本尚未输入完成时就开始输出音频，将感知延迟压到人类对话的自然间隔以内。2025-2026 年间，VoXtream 实现了 102ms 首包延迟，Fish Audio S2 达到 &lt;100ms TTFA——流式合成已经逼近物理极限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>流式 TTS</strong>：在文本尚未输入完成时就开始输出音频，把感知延迟压到人类对话的自然间隔以内</li>\n<li><strong>TTFA（Time-To-First-Audio）</strong>：首包延迟，由文本处理、模型推理、声学解码、网络传输四部分叠加而成</li>\n<li><strong>Output Streaming</strong>：模型等待完整文本，但解码阶段边生成边输出（CosyVoice 2、Fish Audio S1）</li>\n<li><strong>Full Streaming</strong>：文本输入与语音输出同时进行，收到第一个词即发声，挑战在于前瞻信息不足（VoXtream、VibeVoice Realtime）</li>\n<li><strong>Chunk-based 策略</strong>：把目标语音按 200-500ms 分块，生成一块立即输出，配合边界平滑与动态 chunk 大小控制延迟</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延迟的分解与度量\">延迟的分解与度量</h2><p>流式 TTS 的延迟由多个组件叠加：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>TTFA</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>text</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>model</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>decode</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>network</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{TTFA} = T_{\\text{text}} + T_{\\text{model}} + T_{\\text{decode}} + T_{\\text{network}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TTFA</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">text</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">model</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">decode</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">network</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>延迟组件</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>典型范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>text</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{text}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">text</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>文本前端处理</td>\n<td>5-20ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>model</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{model}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">model</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>模型推理首个 chunk</td>\n<td>50-300ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>decode</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{decode}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">decode</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>Codec decoder / 声码器</td>\n<td>10-50ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>network</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{network}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">network</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>网络传输</td>\n<td>20-100ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TTFA 总计</td>\n<td>Time-To-First-Audio</td>\n<td>100-500ms</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"流式架构分类\">流式架构分类</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;Output Streaming&quot;&#10;        A[完整文本输入] --&gt; B[AR 模型&lt;br/&gt;逐 chunk 解码]&#10;        B --&gt; C[边解码边输出]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;Full Streaming&quot;&#10;        D[逐词输入] --&gt; E[增量编码器]&#10;        E --&gt; F[逐 token 生成]&#10;        F --&gt; G[即时输出]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph \"Output Streaming\"\n        A[完整文本输入] --&gt; B[AR 模型&lt;br/&gt;逐 chunk 解码]\n        B --&gt; C[边解码边输出]\n    end\n    subgraph \"Full Streaming\"\n        D[逐词输入] --&gt; E[增量编码器]\n        E --&gt; F[逐 token 生成]\n        F --&gt; G[即时输出]\n    end</pre><p><strong>Output Streaming</strong>：模型仍需等待完整文本，但解码阶段边生成边输出。CosyVoice 2、Fish Audio S1 属此类。</p>\n<p><strong>Full Streaming</strong>：文本输入和语音输出同时进行——模型收到第一个词就开始发声。VoXtream、VibeVoice Realtime 属此类。挑战在于前瞻信息不足。</p>\n<h2 id=\"voxtream-极低延迟全流式\">VoXtream：极低延迟全流式</h2><p>VoXtream（KTH, 2025）通过三层 Transformer 架构实现 102ms 首包延迟：</p>\n<p><strong>增量音素 Transformer</strong>：接收逐词输入，维护有限前瞻窗口，随着更多文本到来更新已发出 token 的上下文表示。</p>\n<p><strong>时序 Transformer</strong>：联合预测 Mimi 语义 token 和时长 token，使用单调对齐约束确保时序不倒转。</p>\n<p><strong>深度 Transformer</strong>：给定语义 token 和说话人嵌入，生成声学 token。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>系统</th>\n<th>首包延迟</th>\n<th>RTF</th>\n<th>训练数据</th>\n<th>零样本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>VoXtream</td>\n<td>102ms</td>\n<td>0.45</td>\n<td>9K h</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CosyVoice 2</td>\n<td>~300ms</td>\n<td>0.5</td>\n<td>170K h</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fish Audio S2</td>\n<td>&lt;100ms</td>\n<td>0.195</td>\n<td>大规模</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VibeVoice Realtime</td>\n<td>~300ms</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>大规模</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"chunk-based-流式策略\">Chunk-based 流式策略</h2><p>Output Streaming 的主流工程方案：将目标语音按 200-500ms 分块，AR 模型生成一个 chunk 后立即送入 decoder 输出波形，同时继续生成下一 chunk。</p>\n<p><strong>边界平滑</strong>：Overlap-and-fade（20-50ms 重叠交叉淡入淡出）、Look-ahead decoding（多生成少量样本作为下一 chunk 上下文）。</p>\n<p><strong>动态 chunk 大小</strong>：句末/停顿处较大 chunk（韵律完整），句中较小 chunk（减少延迟）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推理引擎优化\">推理引擎优化</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[用户请求队列] --&gt; B[连续批处理&lt;br/&gt;Continuous Batching]&#10;    B --&gt; C[GPU 0: 文本编码&lt;br/&gt;+ AR 语义生成]&#10;    C --&gt; D[GPU 1: Flow Matching&lt;br/&gt;声学解码]&#10;    D --&gt; E[CPU: Codec Decoder&lt;br/&gt;波形输出]&#10;    E --&gt; F[流式推送&lt;br/&gt;gRPC / WebSocket]\">flowchart LR\n    A[用户请求队列] --&gt; B[连续批处理&lt;br/&gt;Continuous Batching]\n    B --&gt; C[GPU 0: 文本编码&lt;br/&gt;+ AR 语义生成]\n    C --&gt; D[GPU 1: Flow Matching&lt;br/&gt;声学解码]\n    D --&gt; E[CPU: Codec Decoder&lt;br/&gt;波形输出]\n    E --&gt; F[流式推送&lt;br/&gt;gRPC / WebSocket]</pre><p>关键优化：KV-cache 滑动窗口/PagedAttention 控制内存、连续批处理（continuous batching）提高并发、INT8/INT4 量化提升吞吐、流水线并行最大化硬件利用率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"端到端延迟优化实践\">端到端延迟优化实践</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化手段</th>\n<th>延迟收益</th>\n<th>质量影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>超低帧率 Codec（Mimi 12.5Hz）</td>\n<td>-40% 序列长度</td>\n<td>轻微</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Speculative decoding</td>\n<td>-30% AR 推理时间</td>\n<td>无损</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Flash Attention 2</td>\n<td>-20% attention 计算</td>\n<td>无损</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INT8 量化</td>\n<td>-40% 推理时间</td>\n<td>&lt;0.1 MOS 损失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>gRPC 替代 HTTP</td>\n<td>-30ms 网络延迟</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>流式 TTS 将感知延迟从「整段等待」压缩到 100-300ms 级别</li>\n<li>全流式系统（VoXtream）实现逐词输入即时输出</li>\n<li>Chunk-based 策略是 Output Streaming 的工程主流方案</li>\n<li>生产部署需要 continuous batching、量化、流水线并行的系统级优化</li>\n<li>前沿：首包延迟逼近 100ms 物理极限</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"voice-cloning\">声音克隆与定制</a> —— 流式场景下的说话人条件注入策略</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../nlp-transformers/engineering/efficient-attention\">高效注意力</a> —— 降低流式推理中 attention 开销的核心技术</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"流式语音合成","id":"流式语音合成"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"延迟的分解与度量","id":"延迟的分解与度量"},{"level":2,"text":"流式架构分类","id":"流式架构分类"},{"level":2,"text":"VoXtream：极低延迟全流式","id":"voxtream-极低延迟全流式"},{"level":2,"text":"Chunk-based 流式策略","id":"chunk-based-流式策略"},{"level":2,"text":"推理引擎优化","id":"推理引擎优化"},{"level":2,"text":"端到端延迟优化实践","id":"端到端延迟优化实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"语音编辑模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/models/speech-editing-models"},"next":{"title":"声音克隆与定制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/engineering/voice-cloning"}}